    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:Email\uff1a563883946@qq.com\">Email\uff1a563883946@qq.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of card life. In this world, you can stack cards to synthesize better cards, obtain better attributes, and achieve better outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, dragging the &quot;Inspiration&quot; card to the top of the &quot;Tears&quot; will generate a &quot;Counting&quot; card, which can help you gain more attributes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Characteristics</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\ud83c\udccf  300+collectible cards</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\ud83d\udca1  100+synthesizable formulas</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\u2705  50+playable activities</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\ud83d\udce6  20+different purchasable card packs</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\ud83d\udd52  7-9 hours of game time</strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be over 300 collectible cards in the game, which can be combined with each other or sold to earn coins, and new cards or card packs can be purchased in the store.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developing a life with multiple endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will use dice to advance your life and improve your attributes to achieve different outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/a628f4d47784dd1a63d61347f1a3115c.poster.avif?t=1735816263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/a628f4d47784dd1a63d61347f1a3115c.webm?t=1735816263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/a628f4d47784dd1a63d61347f1a3115c.mp4?t=1735816263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich NPCs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains a variety of NPCs that accompany your growth and playable romantic NPCs, and the rich character background is sure to bring you a different experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat and items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fight against monsters in another world, equip cards to enhance attributes, consume cards to restore status, and also recover different monsters to assist in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/244c1b1267e7e464edc2fce49435bf2a.poster.avif?t=1735816263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/244c1b1267e7e464edc2fce49435bf2a.webm?t=1735816263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/244c1b1267e7e464edc2fce49435bf2a.mp4?t=1735816263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/c7a6cf222808b4e41a98b9d76605f435.poster.avif?t=1735816263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/c7a6cf222808b4e41a98b9d76605f435.webm?t=1735816263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/c7a6cf222808b4e41a98b9d76605f435.mp4?t=1735816263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/b764d8620b85796aacbd28b92e6e4a24.poster.avif?t=1735816263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/b764d8620b85796aacbd28b92e6e4a24.webm?t=1735816263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/b764d8620b85796aacbd28b92e6e4a24.mp4?t=1735816263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Holiday games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be unique mechanism mini games for you to experience during festivals and holidays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/b857dca52f7493122041bdac967c1a3c.poster.avif?t=1735816263\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/b857dca52f7493122041bdac967c1a3c.webm?t=1735816263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292310/extras/b857dca52f7493122041bdac967c1a3c.mp4?t=1735816263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
